{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14128","headline":"送吉州阎使君入道二首 一 · 戎昱","name":"送吉州阎使君入道二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道桃源去，尘心忽自悲。\n余当从宦日，君是弃官时。\n金汞封仙骨，灵津咽玉池。\n受传三籙备，起坐五云随。\n洞里花常发，人间鬓易衰。\n他年会相访，莫作烂柯棊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}